// Generated by Claude Design (Opus 4.7) v0.7 — Settings.
//
// The rule this page now follows, after a sweep of every control on it:
//
//   A control either does the thing it looks like it does, or it is visibly
//   unavailable with the reason on it. There is no third option.
//
// The three failure modes this file used to contain, all of which survived a
// green `tsc -b` and a green `vite build`:
//
//   1. DISPLAYED VALUES THAT WERE NEVER TRUE. The account pane asserted an
//      email address, a phone number, a two-step-verification setting and a
//      last-changed date. The OAuth pane listed four accounts "bound" with live
//      handles. The injector pane reported a version, a latency, an injection
//      time, a DLL SHA-256 and an integrity score of 98/100, and listed four
//      games "detected". None of that came from anywhere: the server has no
//      account, OAuth, or integrity routes, the client scans no disk, and it
//      cannot hash a DLL from a web view.
//   2. CONTROLS THAT CHANGED NOTHING. Three font swatches with no onClick, a
//      font-size "slider" drawn as divs that always read 100%, and four
//      switches (紧凑模式 / 减少动效 / 自动启动游戏 / 原版存档隔离) that flipped a
//      local boolean and were forgotten on reload. These are now real
//      preferences, applied to <html> and persisted (src/lib/prefs.ts), or they
//      are disabled with what is missing.
//   3. A SECTION THAT SHOWED THE WRONG STUB. 个人资料 / 通知 / 网络 had honest
//      "not yet" copy; 快捷键 and 关于 fell through to the same PaneStub and
//      rendered "个人资料还没有开放" under a 关于 heading. 关于 now reports what
//      this build actually talks to.

